{"ID":"20240205153713-6z1kx3w","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153713-6z1kx3w","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153713-6z1kx3w\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091254-nlv26cp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607125107-916hc2s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221194450-sknshy6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:9,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:9\u0026#125;","title":"069茜根（茜草）","type":"doc","updated":"20240807151906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206091254-nlv26cp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091254-nlv26cp","updated":"20240206091303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产河南、陕西、山西等地。\n【性状】\t该品根茎呈结节状，丛生粗细不等的根。根呈圆柱形，略弯曲，长1025cm，直径0.21cm；表面红棕色或暗棕色，具细纵皱纹及少数细根痕；皮部脱落处呈黄红色。质脆，易折断，断面平坦皮部狭，紫红色，木部宽广，浅黄红色，导管孔多数。无臭，味微苦，久嚼刺舌。\n【性味】\t苦，寒。\n【功效】\t凉血，止血，祛瘀，通经，镇咳，祛痰。用于吐血，衄血，崩漏，外伤出血，经闭瘀阻，关节痹痛，跌扑肿痛。现代医学临床研究：可以治疗出血性疾患，慢性气管炎，慢性腹泻，风湿性关节炎，治疗软组织损伤，治疗白细胞减少症。"}]},{"ID":"20240206091254-0yc9ge9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091254-0yc9ge9","updated":"20240206091254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206091254-vwcgig4.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205162650-qb099bm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205162650-qb099bm","updated":"20240205162650"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 471px;","style":"width: 461px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"茜草"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/茜草-20240205162649-t5jowse.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 461px;\" parent-style=\"width: 471px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240807151812-wxvx9mi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240807151812-wxvx9mi","updated":"20240807151812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 427px;","style":"width: 417px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240221194450-1pueyf0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 417px;\" parent-style=\"width: 427px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 412px;","style":"width: 402px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"茜草2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/茜草2-20240619143911-w44idnw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 402px;\" parent-style=\"width: 412px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619144602-eab6qig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619144602-eab6qig","updated":"20240807151815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 884px;","style":"width: 874px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"茜草8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/茜草8-20240705125451-nskowxt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 874px;\" parent-style=\"width: 884px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText